The emucap openMSX build recipe, documentation, and separate Rust control
bridge are licensed GPL-2.0-or-later, the project default.

The pinned openMSX 21.0 source is downloaded into the ignored work tree and
retains its own copyright and license notices. Its README points to the GNU
GPL version 2 text but does not give every default source file an unambiguous
"only" or "or later" grant. The supported adapter therefore does not modify openMSX
source. If a native patch is introduced later, its exact upstream file
licenses must be reviewed before distribution.

The openMSX source package includes C-BIOS machine ROMs under the BSD
2-Clause license. Their original copyright, license, and disclaimer remain
authoritative and must accompany any redistribution.

This repository does not distribute openMSX source or binaries, C-BIOS
binaries, proprietary MSX system ROMs, or game media. See ../../NOTICE.

